{"unit_id":"hzh5021__dsh-progress#card-zh","repo":"hzh5021/dsh-progress","commit":"6044425044e9e3a45bf41b9e8c726d3098f6edf0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-progress 是一个面向 DSH 的后台会话插件：它监听 agent 和 session 事件，按会话记录模型连续无文本输出的步数，并在达到阈值时向 agent 注入一条进度提醒。它只把非空 text 内容视为对用户说话，reasoning 和工具调用不算；遇到无法识别的事件结构时会清零沉默计数。插件支持设置沉默步数、每轮提醒上限和可选的本地诊断探针，并忽略 subagent。适合希望长任务期间 agent 持续报告进度的 DSH 用户。无需 API key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:96-104","lib/index.js:135-169","lib/index.js:227-334"]}
{"unit_id":"hzh5021__dsh-progress#card-en","repo":"hzh5021/dsh-progress","commit":"6044425044e9e3a45bf41b9e8c726d3098f6edf0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-progress tracks consecutive model steps without text and injects a progress reminder at a configurable threshold. It limits reminders per turn, skips subagents, and optionally appends diagnostic notes to a local file. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:96-104","lib/index.js:135-169","lib/index.js:227-334"]}
