{"unit_id":"hzh5021__dsh-progress#feature-1","repo":"hzh5021/dsh-progress","commit":"6044425044e9e3a45bf41b9e8c726d3098f6edf0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-progress 的功能「沉默步数提醒」：连续达到配置步数的模型输出没有非空 text 时，向当前会话的 agent 注入一条汇报进度的提示。默认阈值为两步。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:96-104","lib/index.js:135-168"]}
{"unit_id":"hzh5021__dsh-progress#feature-2","repo":"hzh5021/dsh-progress","commit":"6044425044e9e3a45bf41b9e8c726d3098f6edf0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-progress 的功能「提醒频率控制」：每轮提醒次数受 maxPerTurn 限制，默认最多一次；新一轮开始或结束时会重置计数，避免同一轮重复注入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:45-50","lib/index.js:151-168"]}
{"unit_id":"hzh5021__dsh-progress#feature-3","repo":"hzh5021/dsh-progress","commit":"6044425044e9e3a45bf41b9e8c726d3098f6edf0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-progress 的功能「可选诊断探针」：配置 probeFile 后会将插件启动、会话跟踪和提醒结果追加到指定本地文件；默认关闭，最多写入 400 行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:51-52","lib/index.js:177-195","lib/index.js:234-236"]}
{"unit_id":"hzh5021__dsh-progress#feature-4","repo":"hzh5021/dsh-progress","commit":"6044425044e9e3a45bf41b9e8c726d3098f6edf0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-progress 的功能「注入失败重试」：提醒注入遇到宿主 append 重入错误时按递增间隔重试，最多八次；其他错误停止重试并记录日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:257-283"]}
